JSON Schema:
```json
{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "error": { "type": "string", "enum": ["checkpoint_mismatch"] },
    "message": { "type": "string" },
    "resume_details": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "expected_checkpoint": { "type": "string" },
        "provided_checkpoint": { "type": "string" },
        "kv_crc": { "type": "integer" }
      },
      "required": ["expected_checkpoint", "provided_checkpoint", "kv_crc"]
    }
  },
  "required": ["error", "message", "resume_details"]
}
```

`kv_crc` Computation:
CRC32C checksum computed over the serialized key-value state vector concatenated with the checkpoint sequence identifier.

```json
{
  "error": {
    "code": "checkpoint_mismatch",
